  "ingredients": [
    "16 (3 inch) unbaked tart shells",
    "1 cup raisins",
    "0.75 cup brown sugar",
    "0.25 cup butter, softened",
    "2 eggs",
    "0.5 cup maple syrup",
    "1 tablespoon all-purpose flour",
    "1 tablespoon vanilla extract",
    "1 pinch salt"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/wNGIah8uiIYFIuaJhxwThnieA5E=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/241086-maple-butter-tarts-DDMFS-step-01-fd7cb30a7612494ebfef0930f2bf59ba.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241086/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place tart shells on a baking sheet; sprinkle raisins evenly into the bottom of tart shells.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/7f3RHHgOyhacepV0l-RqXmO1_IQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/241086-maple-butter-tarts-DDMFS-step-02-e68ba3d3a116446f860bda92515ac454.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241086/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat brown sugar and butter together in a bowl until smooth; whisk in eggs, maple syrup, flour, vanilla extract, and salt. Fill each tart shell 3/4 full with maple syrup mixture.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/oULJwbGO31oBmKBHVaei3FxFOb0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/241086-maple-butter-tarts-DDMFS-step-03-6c589a0bbf48462398a6e27952c82d32.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241086/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until filling is set and shells are golden, about 16 minutes. Turn the baking sheet halfway through the baking time for even baking.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
